  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Delhi Police have taken into custody a 14-year-old minor in connection with a security breach of the Agniveer recruitment examination portal. According to official sources and reports, the individual successfully accessed the website to extract the private records of nearly 4,000 military recruitment candidates. The teenager reportedly leveraged an artificial intelligence chatbot to conduct the digital intrusion with the intent of profiting from the stolen data on the dark web. The case highlights ongoing concerns regarding cybersecurity vulnerabilities in government recruitment platforms and the involvement of minors in sophisticated digital crimes. The investigation into how the minor bypassed security protocols and the specifics of the data exposure remains an active matter for law enforcement authorities in the capital.",
